<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>How It Works - GridPermit</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
	<nav class="navbar"><div class="nav-container"><a href="/" class="brand-logo">Grid<strong>Permit</strong></a><a href="/#calculator" class="btn-cta-nav">Get Free Audit</a></div></nav>
	<main class="page-container">
		<h1>How GridPermit Works</h1>
		<p class="lead">3 simple steps to estimate your NEM 3.0 savings and compare certified local solar installers.</p>

		<div class="steps-grid">
			<div class="step-card">
				<div class="step-num">1</div>
				<h3>Enter Baseline Details</h3>
				<p>Provide your California ZIP code and average monthly electric bill. We use regional baseline rates to model your current utility expenses.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step-card">
				<div class="step-num">2</div>
				<h3>Review Estimated ROI</h3>
				<p>See a preliminary comparison between Solar-Only and Solar+Battery storage under California's Net Billing Tariff (NEM 3.0) rules.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="step-card">
				<div class="step-num">3</div>
				<h3>Compare Vetted Quotes</h3>
				<p>Optionally request up to 3 quotes from active, licensed solar and battery installers in your specific utility service area.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<a href="/" class="btn-back">← Back to Calculator</a>
	</main>
	<footer class="footer"><p>© 2026 GridPermit Media LLC. All rights reserved.</p></footer>
	<style>
		:root { --primary: #2563eb; --bg: #f8fafc; --text: #0f172a; }
		body { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
		.navbar { background: white; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 1rem 2rem; }
		.nav-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
		.brand-logo { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.5rem; }
		.btn-cta-nav { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; }
		.page-container { max-width: 820px; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
		h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
		.lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
		.steps-grid { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
		.step-card { background: white; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; position: relative; }
		.step-num { background: var(--primary); color: white; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
		.step-card h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
		.step-card p { color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0; }
		.btn-back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
		.footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin-top: 4rem; }
	</style>
</body>
</html>
